10:29:08.705 | Along the Prelatorian Highway.
10:29:08.706 | The rumble of burdened caravan wheels carries across the area. Crackling ozone heralds warp-touched mirage, their coming the advent of change. Vines have overtaken this location. A wall of celadon-tinged fog deluges the surroundings in the sickly scent of stale water. Dust has drifted over the roadway here, little skiffs of brown that form and rearrange themselves with every shift in the wind. Any tracks left in them are almost immediately wiped away, leaving no trace of their creators. The grasses bend with the breeze and high in the air circle the keen-eyed aerial predators, looking for an unwary rabbit or other small creature to drop their guard. There are 2 daemonic hyenas here. Golden glare fixated on movement, a fierce falcon screams overhead. Crimson eyes burn ardently beneath the black crown of feathers encircling the head of a giant nycticorax. A large wall of stone stands here, blocking passage to the northeast. Tyndran Tabethys Aristata, Tyrannical Butcher of Baelgrim is here. She wields a Shield of Absorption in her left hand and an exquisite Mhaldorian staff of sterling silver in her right. Tomekeeper Harkon d'Ivoire, Scourge of His Legion is here. He wields a leaf-bladed ritual knife in his left hand. Director Nagis Lichlord, Squire of Mhaldor is here. His features are obscured by a charred and torn leather-muzzled mask. He wields a Scimitar of Eagles in each hand. Sir Antoninus Nithilar is here. He wields an elegantly appointed ranger's bow in both hands. Sir Arador Aristata, Knight of Mhaldor is here. He wields a Scimitar of Eagles in each hand. Eradicator Maldrantus is here, hidden. His features are obscured by a mask of lifevision. He wields a Shield of Absorption in his left hand and Agith'maal's ire in his right. He is surrounded by one reflection of himself.
