10:30:46.331 | Flying above A rotting treetrunk.
10:30:46.331 | The rumble of burdened caravan wheels carries across the area. Crackling ozone heralds warp-touched mirage, their coming the advent of change. Vines have overtaken this location. A wall of celadon-tinged fog deluges the surroundings in the sickly scent of stale water. Ethereal mist traces a pale echo of days past and times forgotten. Tomekeeper Harkon d'Ivoire, Scourge of His Legion is here. He wields a leaf-bladed ritual knife in his left hand. Marauder Desitru is here. He wields a solid northern buckler in his left hand and a vorpal sword in his right. Havyn d'Ivoire is here. She wields a Shield of Absorption in her left hand. Director Nagis Lichlord, Squire of Mhaldor is here. His features are obscured by a charred and torn leather-muzzled mask. He wields a Scimitar of Eagles in each hand. Imperial Sommelier Crixos is here, giving off a truly ghastly stench. He wields a vorpal longsword in his left hand and a blackened cavalry shield with ivory accents in his right. Akri is here, hidden. She wields a Shield of Absorption in her left hand and Agith'maal's ire in her right. Sir Antoninus Nithilar is here. He wields a Braincrusher flail in each hand. Silver Sentry Vrox is here. He wields a Shield of Absorption in his left hand and Adchachel's lament in his right. Sir Arador Aristata, Knight of Mhaldor is here. He wields a Scimitar of Eagles in each hand. Servitor Tharonus is here. He wields a Shield of Absorption in his left hand and a living vodun doll of Dunn in his right. The Golden Dragon Sprucebruce's imposing form looms.
