10:32:54.052 | A preserved strip of land.
10:32:54.095 | The rumble of burdened caravan wheels carries across the area. Crackling ozone heralds warp-touched mirage, their coming the advent of change. Vines have overtaken this location. A wall of celadon-tinged fog deluges the surroundings in the sickly scent of stale water. This narrow trail is an island of preserved road among the carnage which has befallen the surroundings. Thick boulders have toppled into the muck below, seemingly having slowed the swelling tide somewhat, and the earth is well packed and miraculously unsullied by the filth which has befouled much of this once fertile land. A large pile of rubble impedes your path to the northwest. Standing silent sentinel, a polished obsidian monolith looms here. A putrid bog hound lurks here, snarling. Like a mountain against the wind, a storm bull is standing here, motionless. There are 2 swarms of bees here. The opaque form of a phantom harp seal drifts here. Exuding umbral menace, a phantom jaguar is crouched here. Crimson eyes burn ardently beneath the black crown of feathers encircling the head of a giant nycticorax. Stretching its wings in an impressive display is an ebony pegasus, its dark coat absorbing the surrounding light. In search of seeds, a Petran starling flutters about. There are 4 corpses of a giant crow here. There are 4 corpses of a mature mountain wildcat here. Hands of rotting flesh and white bone push up from the ground. Tyndran Tabethys Aristata, Tyrannical Butcher of Baelgrim is here. She wields a Shield of Absorption in her left hand and an exquisite Mhaldorian staff of sterling silver in her right. Sir Antoninus Nithilar is here. He wields a Braincrusher flail in each hand. Khovroth Agathon is riding on an ebony pegasus. He wields a Dreadblade bastard sword in both hands. Sir Arador Aristata, Knight of Mhaldor is here. He wields a Scimitar of Eagles in each hand. The Golden Dragon Sprucebruce's imposing form looms. Eradicator Maldrantus is here. His features are obscured by a mask of lifevision. He wields a Shield of Absorption in his left hand and Agith'maal's ire in his right.
