10:33:37.718 | Flying above Entering a gloomy bog.
10:33:37.718 | The rumble of burdened caravan wheels carries across the area. Crackling ozone heralds warp-touched mirage, their coming the advent of change. A wall of celadon-tinged fog deluges the surroundings in the sickly scent of stale water. The heavy scent of decaying vegetation fills this area with an almost overwhelming miasma, hovering in the stagnant air beneath the overhanging mangrove trees. Thick muck and peat layer the ground, making passage difficult and treacherous, and long grass grows up in ragged patches around the bases of the larger trees. The air opens up to the northwest, where the open space of the Prelatorian Highway is barely visible, while the dark gloom of the bog to the south offers a threatening contrast to the road's welcoming smoothness. A noble falcon soars on the thermal currents. An unnatural darkness cloaks the location. Tyndran Tabethys Aristata, Tyrannical Butcher of Baelgrim is here. She wields a Shield of Absorption in her left hand and an exquisite Mhaldorian staff of sterling silver in her right. Director Nagis Lichlord, Squire of Mhaldor is here. His features are obscured by a charred and torn leather-muzzled mask. Sir Antoninus Nithilar is here. He wields Matsuhama's morningstar in each hand. Khovroth Agathon is here. He wields a Dreadblade bastard sword in both hands. Sir Arador Aristata, Knight of Mhaldor is here. He wields a Scimitar of Eagles in each hand. The Golden Dragon Sprucebruce's imposing form looms. Eradicator Maldrantus is here. His features are obscured by a mask of lifevision. He wields a Shield of Absorption in his left hand and Agith'maal's ire in his right.
